        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Brent Burns, Evgeni Nabokov\n- Organizations: Canada men's national ice hockey team, Russia men's national ice hockey team, San Jose Sharks, National Hockey League, IIHF World Championship\n- Roles: Defenceman, Goaltender, Forward\n\nFacts:\n- William Brent Burns was born on March 9, 1985.\n- Brent Burns is a Canadian professional ice hockey player who primarily plays defenceman and has also been used as a forward.\n- Brent Burns currently plays for the San Jose Sharks of the National Hockey League.\n- At the 2008 IIHF World Championship, Canadian Brent Burns was named the tournament's top defenceman.\n- At the 2008 IIHF World Championship, Russia's Evgeni Nabokov was selected as the tournament's top goaltender.",
